## Retro

writeMethodology is moderately bloated because most of its content is
already in the parent install service spec and the project trunk. The fix
is to commit to "writes the marker-bounded pointer stub into the host's
framework config file; idempotent, surgical insert, never replaces user
content outside the markers" and let the parent carry the surgical-insert
mechanism.
